    "_postman_id": "8d8a53d2-bf45-41da-a265-e887724ba376",
    "name": "LeadGenius Enrichment Campaigns API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "The LeadGenius public API is a RESTful API that sends and receives records from the LeadGenius Dashboard product. Records are associated to Campaigns in Dashboard and consist of Accounts that can optionally include related Contact records. A Campaign can be created in Dashboard using the Dashboard Wizard or via the API; any Campaign in Dashboard can be accessed using the API.\n\nTwo modes are offered. **Campaign (batch) enrichment** uploads records to a Campaign, LeadGenius enriches or appends contacts, and a webhook fires when records are finalized so they can be retrieved. **Rapid enrichment** submits a single account or contact (or a get_contacts request) for real-time enrichment and retrieves the enriched record by id.\n\nThis description was captured by the API Evangelist enrichment pipeline from the published LeadGenius API reference at https://docs.leadgenius.com/ — LeadGenius does not publish a machine readable OpenAPI definition. Every path, method, parameter, field and error code below is transcribed from that reference and its Python/JavaScript/cURL samples.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: LeadGenius Sales\n Email: sales@leadgenius.com",
      "type": "text/plain"
    }
  }
